    "text": "Let x, y, z be probability of E<sub>1</sub>, E<sub>2</sub>, E<sub>3</sub> respectively<br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&rArr;</mo> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtext>x</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>y</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>z</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mi>&alpha;</mi> </mrow> </math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&rArr;</mo> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtext>y</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>x</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>z</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mi>&beta;</mi> </mrow> </math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&rArr;</mo> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtext>z</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>x</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>y</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mi>&gamma;</mi> </mrow> </math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&rArr;</mo> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>x</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>y</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mtext>z</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>P</mtext> </mrow> </math><br />Putting in the given relation we get x = 2y and y = 3z<br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&rArr;</mo> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mtext>x</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mn>6</mn> <mtext>z</mtext> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mo>&rArr;</mo> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>x</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>z</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mn>6</mn> </mrow> </math>"
